Package: nova-x-desktop
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-httpx (>= 0.27), python3-pydantic (>= 2.8), python3-keyring (>= 23), python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets
Maintainer: NOVA X contributors
Description: Local-first native Linux desktop assistant
 NOVA X is a local desktop assistant with a native Qt interface, SQLite task and
 command history, scoped workspaces, structured process execution, explicit
 approval gates, and optional cloud-model API profiles.
 .
 Provider credentials are kept in a Linux Secret Service keyring. Commands run
 as the logged-in user by default. No daemon or network listener is installed.
